                <pb facs="0676" n="564" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg564"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4001/19.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Archbishop Nuttall</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President much pleased with your kindly message, and directs me to express
                    his warmest thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
